===== STAGE100 TX CALLBACK DEFERRAL AUDIT =====
PASS: MPSC_STACK_ATOMIC_PUSH_AND_DETACH: intrusive MPSC operations do not allocate, lock, or reclaim
PASS: SKBUFF_EMBEDS_RETIRE_NODE: each skb carries its own allocation-free retire node
PASS: HEADER_EXPORTS_DEFERRED_OWNERSHIP_API: shared C/C++ ownership-transfer API is declared
PASS: PRODUCER_FAILS_CLOSED_WITHOUT_SYNC_FREE: closed runtime quarantines skb rather than falling back to IOFree
PASS: PRODUCER_DOES_ATOMIC_PUSH_AND_THREADCALL_SIGNAL: producer boundary performs only atomics, intrusive publication and signal
PASS: DEFERRED_CONSUMER_IS_ONLY_REAPER_KFREE: detached consumer performs the final skb reclaim
PASS: REAPER_SINGLE_FLIGHT_RESIGNAL: enqueue racing an active reaper is observed by the state handshake
PASS: INIT_CREATES_REAPER_BEFORE_ADMISSION: TX skb free admission opens only after kernel-priority reaper allocation
PASS: INIT_ROLLBACK_RELEASES_PARTIAL_REAPER: failed initialization unwinds the partially allocated compat runtime
PASS: EXIT_CLOSES_AND_DRAINS_AFTER_PRODUCERS_STOP: teardown closes producers, joins reaper, drains final batch, then frees call
PASS: EXIT_RETAINS_RUNTIME_ON_DRAIN_FAILURE: runtime is retained when deferred ownership cannot be proven empty
PASS: TX_STATUS_CALLBACK_TRANSFERS_SKB: callback returns skb ownership to generic compat reaper
PASS: MISSING_CALLBACK_FALLBACK_IS_DEFERRED: missing status callback cannot free synchronously under driver lock
PASS: TX_STATUS_CALLBACK_HAS_NO_DIAGNOSTIC_IO: one-shot completion remains; frame parsing and IOLog are removed from locked path
PASS: LEGACY_RUNTIME_INIT_FAILURE_IS_CHECKED: legacy start cannot proceed without the required compat reaper
PASS: LEGACY_EXIT_GUARDED_BY_INIT_FLAG: legacy teardown exits only the runtime it initialized
PASS: WCL_RUNTIME_INIT_ALREADY_CHECKED: native WCL preserves its checked compat runtime lifecycle
